### Prueba de Mutante (Debe dar 200 OK)
POST http://localhost:9090/mutant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dna": [
    "ATGCGA",
    "CAGTGC",
    "TTATGT",
    "AGAAGG",
    "CCCCTA",
    "TCACTG"
  ]
}

### Prueba de Humano (Debe dar 403 Forbidden)
POST http://localhost:9090/mutant
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dna": [
    "ATGCGA",
    "CAGTGC",
    "TTATTT",
    "AGACGG",
    "GCGTCA",
    "TCACTG"
  ]
}

### Ver Estadísticas
GET http://localhost:9090/stats